{"id":"ab30e819a33f233a","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 Fat Splitting Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree — ZFC Tree9 Fat Splitting Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree — ZFC Tree9 Fat Splitting Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree — ZFC Tree9 Fat Splitting Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"498c1bab1b62f288\" href=\"?note=498c1bab1b62f288\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R_T\\in V\">\\(T,R_T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (finite-sequence length predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"498c1bab1b62f288\" href=\"?note=498c1bab1b62f288\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FatSplittingTree}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FatSplittingTree}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}fat\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FatSplittingTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\n\\land T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\exists t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\ns\\subseteq t\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S(n,t)\n\\land t^\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\in T\n\\land t^\\frown\\langle1\\rangle\\in T\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}fat\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FatSplittingTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\n\\land T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\exists t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\ns\\subseteq t\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S(n,t)\n\\land t^\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\in T\n\\land t^\\frown\\langle1\\rangle\\in T\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Above every node, every sufficiently large level contains an actual binary\nsplitting node.  The former “arbitrarily large” clause described only a\nperfect tree and was strictly weaker than fat splitting.</li>\n<li>The prefix order is explicitly restricted to the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\times T\">\\(T\\times T\\)</span> before it is passed to the tree predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md","status":"resolved","id":"498c1bab1b62f288","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (tree-order predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md","status":"resolved","id":"498c1bab1b62f288","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (finite-sequence length predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-length.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,R_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FatSplittingTree}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}fat\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9FatSplittingTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\n\\land T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\exists t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\ns\\subseteq t\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceLength}_S(n,t)\n\\land t^\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\in T\n\\land t^\\frown\\langle1\\rangle\\in T\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T\\times T","display":false}],"bytes":1735,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3831","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree9-fat-splitting-tree]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","498c1bab1b62f288"]}